# vulkan-full-comparison.md) stay tracked; only local vk-*/cuda-* run dirs are ignored.
/benchmark/reports/vk-*/
/benchmark/reports/cuda-*/

# imatrix calibration outputs (large, not for git)
imatrix-out/
